sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Shopper
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant OS as Order Service Pods
    participant PG as PostgreSQL 16 ACID DB
    participant K as Kafka Broker orders.lifecycle.v1
    participant RELAY as Debezium CDC Relay

    Note over Shopper,PG: 1. Payment Success & Transactional Outbox Commit
    Shopper->>GW: POST /api/v1/payments/execute
    GW->>OS: Process Payment Intent (Stripe 200 OK)
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    OS->>PG: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    OS->>PG: INSERT INTO orders (status = 'CONFIRMED')
    OS->>PG: INSERT INTO transactional_outbox (status = 'PENDING')
    OS->>PG: COMMIT
    end
    OS-->>Shopper: HTTP 200 OK (Order Confirmed)

    Note over OS,K: 2. CHAOS INJECTION: Downstream Order Service Crash
    Note over OS: Chaos Trigger: Order Service Pods Terminated (Simulated Outage)
    Note over OS: Order Service status = CRASHED (Offline)

    rect rgb(255, 245, 235)
    Note over PG,K: 3. Resilient Buffering in Kafka Queue Log
    PG-.->|"Tails Postgres WAL"| RELAY
    RELAY->>K: Publish to topic orders.lifecycle.v1
    K->>K: Events Buffer Safely in Kafka Log (Lag Accumulates)
    end

    Note over OS,K: 4. RECOVERY: Pods Restored & High-Speed Buffer Drainage
    Note over OS: Kubernetes Auto-Restart Provisions New Pods
    Note over OS: Order Service status = RECOVERED (Online)
    
    rect rgb(235, 255, 245)
    OS->>K: Re-join Consumer Group (salestorm-order-consumers)
    K-->>OS: Stream Buffered Messages
    OS->>OS: Drain and Process All Buffered Events in 54ms
    OS->>PG: UPDATE transactional_outbox SET status = 'PUBLISHED'
    end
    Note over OS,K: Buffer Drain Completed in 54ms. Zero Message Loss.
